/* One owner for squat + bench + deadlift club totals. Progress and Profile both consume this snapshot
   so the number a lifter screenshots can never disagree with the number in Records. "Lifted" uses
   the heaviest load actually logged on each lift; estimated mode uses the best e1RM. Traditional club
   membership requires all three lifts and actual lifted loads — a projected e1RM total is labelled as
   projected everywhere rather than quietly awarding the club early. */

